ng to put a lovely flavor  on that incredible biscuit  mushroom's getting lots of color  now  look at those mushrooms  so beautiful the colors as they cook  it almost sort of bursts like a bright  orange  from the sunshine  get that bacon fat running down into the  biscuit  get it really nice and crispy  now for my eggs  with the eggs i like to cook the eggs  with a little bit of heat  touch of olive oil in first  then get your butter in get that froth  get that frothing  it's so hot here  a little touch  of chili seeds in there okay  turn my biscuit over oh my lord  look at that  you can't buy that flavor  look at that bacon  so beautiful  eggs  start cracking  now get the eggs in  flat surface  in  and crack  and crack nicely  beautiful  take my biscuit out  i get set  on my plate  ready to roll  beautiful  so beautiful  now a little trick  with this bacon  a little  delays  with this this is apple moonshine and  trust me  he's got a kick stronger than mule  that's going to glaze the bacon in she  goes  oh  man  look at that  50 percent alcohol  look at that season the top of the eggs  butter  is doing its magic  popping over chili's giving a little bit  of heat to the eggs  beautiful  look at that blister  and look at that bacon now reduce that  bacon all the way down to absolutely  evaporates  and then we start  the magical moment we start to assemble  this  first off  get your eggs  and just open them up  nicely lift that out with the chili  and just sit that  on one  side of your biscuit look at those  mushrooms  i mean  the color  is ridiculous the smell  is amazing get that bacon it's gotten  slightly crispy but sort of caramelized  give it a little bit of height so it  gives a bit of beauty on the plate  and then finally  i've got some beautiful smoky mountain  beans  and that's going to just sit right at  the very top  and when i said to you  it is a smoky mountains breakfast  trust me  that is a breakfast of champions  because right now with that in my hands  i feel as happy  as a bear up a tree with his hands in a  honey pot  or as local would say  happy as a pig in shed  now if you enjoyed that recipe please  click the link below and if you missed  uncharted then please watch on catch up  on disney plus  [Music]

